---
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro'; import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../config/site';
---
<Prose bg="india-wellness" title="Accessibility statement" kicker="Accessibility" desc="GovPulse aims to meet WCAG 2.2 level AA. Known limitations and how to report a barrier.">
<h2>Our target</h2><p>We aim to conform to <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/">WCAG 2.2</a> level AA.</p>
<h2>What we do</h2><ul><li>Text contrast of at least 4.5:1; the monochrome palette is measured on the darkest card colour.</li><li>Up and down changes always use arrows and screen-reader text, never colour alone.</li><li>Visible keyboard focus, a skip link, and keyboard-operable chart dialogs with a data table for screen readers.</li><li>Animations, background videos and the custom cursor are disabled when your system asks for reduced motion. With Save-Data on, videos show a still image only.</li><li>Automated checks with axe-core on key pages before each release.</li></ul>
<h2>Known limitations</h2><ul><li>Interactive chart canvases are visual; the same data is provided as a hidden table in the expanded view and through the public API.</li><li>Background videos are decorative and have no audio.</li></ul>
<h2>Feedback</h2><p>If you hit a barrier, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. We aim to reply within 5 working days.</p>
</Prose>
